Package: causallinkageResearch
Title: Research Compendium for Causal Inference with Uncertain Record Linkage
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Finite-population derivations, graph-constrained sensitivity analysis,
    validation-sample correction, simulation, and a read-only empirical adapter.
    This is a research compendium, not a released statistical package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: lpSolve, stringdist, sandwich
Suggests: testthat, lintr, styler, arrow, dplyr, stringi, digest, renv
